Migration from kRPC 0.8.0
=========================

This service replaces kRPC 0.8.0's MechJeb service, which supports MechJeb 2.15. MechJeb 2.16
replaces the PVG ascent with PSG and removes the aircraft autopilot, so some members moved,
were renamed or were removed. kRPC 0.8.0's names are given as in C#.

.. list-table::
   :header-rows: 1
   :widths: 35 35 30

   * - kRPC 0.8.0
     - This service
     - Note
   * - ``AscentType.PVG``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentType.PSG') }}
     -
   * - ``AscentGuidance.PVGSettings``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentGuidance.PSGSettings') }}
     - The PVG stage settings have no replacement, as PSG plans the stages itself
   * - ``AscentGuidance.DesiredApoapsis``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentGuidance.ApoapsisAltitude') }}
     - With {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentGuidance.PeriapsisAltitude') }}, in place of
       ``DesiredOrbitAltitude``
   * - ``AscentGuidance.AttachAltFlag``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentGuidance.BurnoutAltitudeFlag') }}
     -
   * - ``AscentGuidance.DesiredAttachAlt``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentGuidance.BurnoutAltitude') }}
     -
   * - ``AscentGuidance.DesiredFPA``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentGuidance.FlightPathAngle') }}
     -
   * - ``AscentGuidance.LaunchToMatchLan``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentGuidance.LaunchToTargetLan') }}
     -
   * - ``AscentLaunchMode.MatchLan``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentLaunchMode.TargetLan') }}
     -
   * - ``AscentGuidance.LaunchToRendezvous``, ``LaunchPhaseAngle``
     -
     - Removed, as in MechJeb 2.16
   * - ``AscentSettings.CorrectiveSteering``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.ClassicPath.CorrectiveSteering') }}
     - With ``CorrectiveSteeringGain``
   * - ``AscentSettings.LimitAngleOfAttack``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.ClassicPath.LimitAngleOfAttack') }}
     - With ``MaxAngleOfAttack`` and ``AngleOfAttackLimitFadeoutPressure``
   * - ``AscentSettings.SkipCircularization``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.ClassicPath.SkipCircularization') }}
     -
   * - ``AscentSettings.AutodeploySolarPanels``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentSettings.AutoDeploySolarPanels') }}
     -
   * - ``AscentSettings.Staging``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentSettings.Staging') }}
     - The ascent's own staging settings, in place of {{ see('T:MechJeb.Autostaging') }}
   * - ``AscentSettings.Thrust``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentSettings.Thrust') }}
     - The ascent's own throttle limits, in place of {{ see('T:MechJeb.ThrustLimiter') }}
   * - ``AscentSettings.Autowarp``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.AscentSettings.Autowarp') }}
     - The ascent's own, no longer shared with the maneuver planner
   * - ``LandingGuidance.Autowarp``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.LandingGuidance.Autowarp') }}
     - The landing's own, no longer shared with the maneuver planner
   * - ``AircraftAutopilot``, ``AircraftApproach``
     -
     - Removed, as MechJeb 2.16 has no aircraft autopilot
   * - ``ManeuverPlanner.OperationInterplanetaryTransfer``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.ManeuverPlanner.OperationAdvancedTransfer') }}
     -
   * - ``OperationTransfer.Rendezvous``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.OperationTransfer.MatchOrbit') }}
     - The inverse
   * - ``OperationAdvancedTransfer``
     - {{ see('M:MechJeb.OperationAdvancedTransfer.Mode') }}
     - Defaults to the porkchop mode. Set it to limited time for the search of kRPC 0.8.0

Members not listed keep their names and classes. {{ see('M:MechJeb.SmartRCS.RCSThrottle') }}
and {{ see('M:MechJeb.ThrustLimiter.LimiterMinThrottle') }} default to false in MechJeb 2.16.
